{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 正式宣佈推出全新 MacBook Pro，這是該品牌首款配備觸控功能及 PROLED XDR 螢幕的筆記型電腦。新機採用串聯 OLED（Tandem OLED）技術，並保留發光 Apple 標誌設計，於 10 月 28 日由新任行政總裁 John Ternus 透過社交媒體平台首次公開亮相。</p>\n<h2>John Ternus 展示新機細節</h2>\n<p>在 Apple 於 10 月 19 日預熱「Pro and tell」體驗活動後，新任行政總裁 John Ternus 隨後分享了這款筆電的聚光燈預告。他在個人社群帳號上表示：「我們對全新的 MacBook Pro 感到興奮不已。你得親手觸摸它才能相信。」配圖中可見他使用了以新款 Mac 為主題的新頭像。值得注意的是，Apple 此前曾在 12 吋 MacBook 及 2016 年款 MacBook Pro 之後，多年未在筆記型電腦硬體上使用發光的 Apple 標誌。</p>\n<h2><strong>定價及推出日期</strong></h2>\n<p>香港區現已接受預訂，14 吋版本定價HK$22,999  起，16 吋版本 HK$26,999 起。台灣則於 10 月 30 日上午 9 點開始預訂，14 吋定價 NT$97,900 起，16 吋定價 NT$114,900 起。新 MacBook Pro 會在 11 月 6 日正式出貨。</p>\n<p><strong>相關網址：<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/shop/buy-mac/macbook-pro-proled-xdr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港</a> / <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tw/shop/buy-mac/macbook-pro-proled-xdr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">台灣</a></strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"IMG 6221\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"555\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_6221.jpeg\" width=\"832\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>We’re glowing with excitement over the new MacBook Pro. You’ve gotta touch it to believe it. <a href=\"https://t.co/BLiGkGaefL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/BLiGkGaefL</a></p>— John Ternus (@johnternus) <a href=\"https://x.com/johnternus/status/2115490555480461555?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 28, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-mac/macbook-pro-proled-xdr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:00:41.585327+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":745,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T17:28:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:35.452179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:35.452179+00:00","content_hash":"e5efea59c9e4fefaacc66d06a067aa75284570e5b0ab33f40b11b43c8cf1569d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}